# Guitar Freaks 2nd Mix (GQ883 VER. EAA), Konami 1999: as gtrfrk2m-boot.his. First power-on from blank NVRAM, no inputs: the 573 BIOS boots the
# CD (the flash is blank), which asks "DO YOU WANT TO INITIALIZE FLASH-ROM?" by frame ~1200. Hashes
# the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game gtrfrk2ma

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 3000 quit
